                  <span class="column vDeLzQwY large-12"><p class="copy PVOyRkzv channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 125, 250, 0.6)"><span style="font-weight: 500">Automatic Switching:</span> Requires an Apple&nbsp;Account and a compatible Apple device running the latest operating system software.</p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="EmgBxfse" role="listitem">
                <div class="row hciemfyj large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column aZUgyKoV large-12"><p class="copy hXSSuMtN channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 125, 250, 0.6)"><span style="font-weight: 500">Battery:</span> Battery life depends on device settings, environment, usage and many other factors.</p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="DnItsaqf" role="listitem">
                <div class="row TkUmouyi large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column qDrGPqwX large-12"><p class="copy znOwLIqM channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 125, 250, 0.6)">
                    Testing conducted by Apple in July and August 2026 using pre-production AirPods&nbsp;5 and AirPods&nbsp;5 with Wireless Charging Case paired with pre-production iPhone&nbsp;18&nbsp;Pro units, all with pre-release software. The playlist consisted of 358 unique audio tracks purchased from the iTunes&nbsp;Store (256-Kbps AAC encoding). Volume was set to 50%, Spatial&nbsp;Audio and Conversation&nbsp;Awareness were off, and Noise Control was set to Active&nbsp;Noise Cancellation. 
                    With Noise Control turned off, listening time for AirPods&nbsp;5 was up to 6 hours, and listening time for AirPods&nbsp;5 with Wireless Charging Case was up to 7 hours. Testing consisted of full AirPods battery discharge while playing audio until the first AirPod stopped playback.
                    </p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="fEgETVBc" role="listitem">
                <div class="row yljBxBui large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column xaFEHRsy large-12"><p class="copy dsCHVbrh channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 125, 250, 0.6)">
                      Testing conducted by Apple in July and August 2026 using pre-production AirPods&nbsp;5 and charging case and AirPods&nbsp;5 with Wireless Charging Case paired with pre-production iPhone&nbsp;18&nbsp;Pro units, all with pre-release software. The playlist consisted of 358 unique audio tracks purchased from the iTunes&nbsp;Store (256-Kbps AAC encoding). Volume was set to 50%, Spatial Audio and Conversation Awareness were off, and Noise Control was set to Active Noise
                      Cancellation. Testing consisted of full AirPods battery discharge while playing audio until the first AirPod stopped playback. The drained AirPods were charged to 100%, then audio playback was resumed until the first AirPod stopped playback. This cycle was repeated until both the AirPods and charging case were fully discharged. 
                   
                    </p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="oWTvQTAG" role="listitem">
                <div class="row TLHhhnwI large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column fbzRyiBX large-12"><p class="copy MEuCouoh channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 125, 250, 0.6)"><span style="font-weight: 500">Charging Case:</span> USB-C charging requires a compatible USB-C charger. Wireless charging requires a Qi-certified wireless charger or the Apple&nbsp;Watch charger. MagSafe charging requires a compatible MagSafe charger.</p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="xMdNTNvo" role="listitem">
                <div class="row UbxzjInh large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column eJjLSuzc large-12"><p class="copy HCtVDZzW channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 113, 227, 100%)">
                      <span style="font-weight: 500">Dust, Sweat and Water Resistance:</span> AirPods&nbsp;5 and AirPods&nbsp;Pro&nbsp;3 are dust, sweat and water resistant for non-water sports and exercise. Products including charging case were tested under controlled laboratory conditions, and have a rating of IP57 under IEC standard 60529. Dust, sweat and water resistance are not permanent conditions, and resistance might decrease as a result of normal wear. Do not attempt to charge when wet; refer to <a href="https://support.apple.com/en-in/105046" class="footer-link"><span style="color: #424245; white-space: nowrap">support.apple.com/en-in/105046</span></a> for cleaning and drying instructions.
                    </p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="BvxdtaBu" role="listitem">
                <div class="row ZAIkyVmY large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column FDCnMaAs large-12"><p class="copy zAfPbdsD channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 125, 250, 0.6)"><span style="font-weight: 500">Find&nbsp;My:</span> Find&nbsp;My functionality requires iOS&nbsp;27 or later.</p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
             
              <li class="rEHAwdxs" role="listitem">
                <div class="row KlILcywQ large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column SJffNmqf large-12"><p class="copy crBxdPpE channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 125, 250, 0.6)"><span style="font-weight: 500">Hearing&nbsp;Test:</span> The Hearing&nbsp;Test  feature is supported on AirPods&nbsp;Pro&nbsp;2 and later with the latest firmware paired with a compatible iPhone or iPad with iOS&nbsp;18 or iPadOS&nbsp;18 and later, and it is intended for people 18 years old or older.</p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="hRPKjqnO" role="listitem">
                <div class="row flMKivmk large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column jZfJGMxV large-12"><p class="copy LuypLHBy channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 113, 227, 100%)">
                      <span style="font-weight: 500">Heart Rate Sensing:</span> Built-in heart rate monitor is intended for use during workouts with the Fitness app and compatible third-party apps on iPhone running iOS&nbsp;26 and later. Refer to <a href="https://support.apple.com/en-in/123184" class="footer-link"><span style="color: #424245; white-space: nowrap">support.apple.com/en-in/123184</span></a> for more information.
                    </p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="salBZEwM" role="listitem">
                <div class="row HtFFJQoH large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column fqQiPlpF large-12"><p class="copy gtcrLTpD channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 125, 250, 0.6)"><span style="font-weight: 500">“Hey Siri”:</span> Siri may not be available in all languages or in all regions, and features may vary by region. Compatible device and internet access are required. Cellular data charges may&nbsp;apply.</p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="YJMMBltL" role="listitem">
                <div class="row cIjfVxnQ large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column byQabMpV large-12"><p class="copy hGEgbuBN channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 113, 227, 100%)">
                      <span style="font-weight: 500">Live&nbsp;Translation:</span> Available on compatible Apple devices with the latest operating system software when paired with compatible AirPods with the latest firmware when Apple&nbsp;Intelligence is turned on. Available in beta. Some features may not be available in all regions or languages; for more information, see
                      <a href="https://apple.com/in/ios/feature-availability/#apple-intelligence-live-translation-with-airpods." class="footer-link"><span style="color: #424245">apple.com/in/ios/feature-availability/#apple-intelligence-live-translation-with-airpods</span></a>.
                    </p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="yspuRFva" role="listitem">
                <div class="row oYPQGRAS large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column LAzGBioP large-12"><p class="copy sSiaRWoo channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 125, 250, 0.6)">
                      <span style="font-weight: 500">Personalised Spatial&nbsp;Audio:</span> Compatible hardware and software are required. Works with compatible content in supported apps. Not all content is available in Dolby Atmos. iPhone with TrueDepth&nbsp;camera is required to create a personal profile for Personalised Spatial&nbsp;Audio, which will sync across Apple devices running the latest operating system software, including iOS, iPadOS, macOS and tvOS. Personalised Spatial&nbsp;Audio is not available when using other devices.</p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="LCiSPFmI" role="listitem">
                <div class="row ndCqBVrl large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column vKINycxy large-12"><p class="copy ehJLoGxF channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 113, 227, 100%)">
                      <span style="font-weight: 500">Siri&nbsp;AI:</span> 
                      Apple&nbsp;Intelligence is available with Siri and device language set to Chinese (Simplified), Chinese (Traditional), Danish, Dutch, English, French, German, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Portuguese, Spanish, Swedish, Turkish or Vietnamese. Some features may not be available in all regions or languages. Some devices may not be available in all regions. Siri&nbsp;AI is available in beta in iOS&nbsp;27, 
                      macOS&nbsp;27 and watchOS&nbsp;27, and requires an Apple&nbsp;Intelligence–enabled device set to a supported language. Available in English to start. Siri&nbsp;AI will not be initially available in the EU on iOS, iPadOS and watchOS. Certain Apple&nbsp;Intelligence features that rely on server-side models are subject to daily usage limits, including but not limited to Siri&nbsp;AI, Intelligent Photo Editing Tools, Image Playground and AFM 3 Cloud models in Shortcuts. Daily 
                      limits may vary by feature, request complexity, system demand, system policies and other factors. Expanded access to such features will be available for a fee in the future. Use of these features is subject to the Apple&nbsp;Intelligence Terms and Conditions. Learn more at <a href="https://apple.com/in/apple-intelligence." class="footer-link"><span style="color: #424245; white-space: nowrap">apple.com/in/apple-intelligence</span></a>. Hands-free access to Siri&nbsp;AI works on all AirPods.
                    </p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="FdLKjQwH" role="listitem">
                <div class="row YQceTeAj large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column sRHzHPyf large-12"><p class="copy xvMKdtyb channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 125, 250, 0.6)"><span style="font-weight: 500">Up to 1.5x More Active&nbsp;Noise Cancellation:</span> Up to 1.5x more Active&nbsp;Noise Cancellation than the previous generation when tested in accordance with IEC 60268-24.</p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="eBKkKSoP" role="listitem">
                <div class="row yKKRmWwg large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column WXwWxNrI large-12"><p class="copy dvemvsAC channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 125, 250, 0.6)"><span style="font-weight: 500">Up to 3x More Active&nbsp;Noise Cancellation:</span> Up to 3x more Active&nbsp;Noise Cancellation compared with AirPods&nbsp;5 when tested in accordance with IEC 60268-24.</p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
